    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-56" id="fn-56" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">The Environmental provision has been reclassified form accounts 253 and 242 to account 228.4 in 2025 to conform to current year presentation.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-57" id="fn-57" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Derivative balances in accounts 175 and 244 have been reclassified to accounts 176 and 245, respectively, in 2025 to conform to current year presentation.</link:footnote>
